{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜剖析中俄美元首會晤(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-20-13-02-49lu1dIMnO.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：剖析中俄美元首會晤</p><p>中俄美元首歷史性會晤，席間討論的議題，對三方關係有何促進作用？對亞太經濟體合作、乃至整體國際格局又有何影響？</p><p>嘉賓：</p><p>時事評論員張少威</p><p>港大APEC研究中心主任鄧希煒</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.270561+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T05:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T20:37:33.862609+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:23.643118+00:00","content_hash":"7ba4f1c0b2c2c56999bd43724a7d23c7236ad2084dd93f8929e508656d070180","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.270561+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}